You breathe lightning in a frontal cone of radius [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)]. Any target caught in the area will take [67, 86, 101, 113, 124 (TL1-5; STR 100)] to [201, 259, 303, 339, 371 (TL1-5; STR 100)] lightning damage ([134, 173, 202, 226, 247 (TL1-5; STR 100)] average) and be stunned for 3 turns.

The damage will increase with your Strength, and the critical chance is based on your Mental crit rate, and the Stun apply power is based on your Mindpower.

Each point in storm drake talents also increases your lightning resistance by 1%.
